&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If two point such as (xi,yi,zi) and (xj,yj,zj) xi≥xj yi≥yj zi≥zj, the bigger one level add 1&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>BZOJ 3262: 陌上花开 (cdq分治模板题，三维偏序)</title><link>https://111qqz.com/2017/10/bzoj-3262/</link><pubDate>Tue, 10 Oct 2017 11:43:22 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/2017/10/bzoj-3262/</guid><description>&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;Description
 &lt;div id="description" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
